        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{36}{125}$",
          "worked": "Exactly two heads occurs as $HHT$, $HTH$ or $THH$. These three orders have equal probabilities.\n$$\\begin{align*}P(2H)&=3\\times\\left(\\frac{2}{5}\\right)^2\\times\\frac{3}{5}\\\\P(2H)&=\\frac{36}{125}\\end{align*}$$",
